WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.697
Tor flapped and kicked.

2
00:00:07.698 --> 00:00:17.982
She got free of the vines.

3
00:00:17.983 --> 00:00:21.221
Everyone pulled thorns from Sid's foot.

4
00:00:21.222 --> 00:00:31.947
"Thanks," Sid said.

5
00:00:31.948 --> 00:00:34.977
Sara looked around.

6
00:00:34.978 --> 00:00:39.398
"This spot is a mess," she said.

7
00:00:39.399 --> 00:00:43.237
"Let's clean it up."

8
00:00:43.238 --> 00:00:47.847
"Good idea." Tor dug through her bag.

9
00:00:47.848 --> 00:00:51.491
She found a duster.

10
00:00:51.492 --> 00:00:57.906
Everyone laughed.

11
00:00:57.907 --> 00:01:03.430
"That duster won't help us," Sara said.

12
00:01:03.431 --> 00:01:10.012
Sid picked up branches.

13
00:01:10.013 --> 00:01:12.188
"Ouch!" Sara said.

14
00:01:12.189 --> 00:01:16.700
"How can we cut these thorns?"

15
00:01:16.701 --> 00:01:20.337
Tor dug through her bag again.

16
00:01:20.338 --> 00:01:24.774
She handed Sara a saw.

17
00:01:24.775 --> 00:01:29.714
"Perfect!" Sara said.

18
00:01:29.715 --> 00:01:39.020
Sara cut the thorns.

19
00:01:39.021 --> 00:01:44.403
Then Tor cut the vines.

20
00:01:44.404 --> 00:01:50.133
Rex picked up the nuts.

21
00:01:50.134 --> 00:01:55.733
He threw them behind some bushes.

22
00:01:55.734 --> 00:02:00.607
"Our spot looks clean now," Tor said.

23
00:02:00.608 --> 00:02:04.622
"I'm thirsty."

24
00:02:04.623 --> 00:02:12.440
Everyone went to the stream.

25
00:02:12.441 --> 00:02:18.389
Soon they came back.

26
00:02:18.390 --> 00:02:24.771
There was a new nut pile!

